{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34393","headline":"新夏东郊闲泛有怀袭美 · 陆龟蒙","name":"新夏东郊闲泛有怀袭美","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迟於春日好於秋，野客相携上钓舟。\n经略彴时冠暂亚，佩笭箵後带频搊。\n蒹葭鹭起波摇笠，村落蚕眠树挂钩。\n料得祗君能爱此，不争烟水似封侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34393.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34393","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}